      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "迅速！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FC5901FFF0100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "又華麗地！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53C883EF9E975730FF0100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如行雲流水般！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982884C96F26D416C34822CFF0100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "發動好幾次攻擊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767C52D5597D5E7E6B21653B64CA300200100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是全都擊中，\n必定能造成巨大傷害！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F516890FD64CA4E2DFF0C000A5FC55B9A80FD902062105DE8592750B75BB3FF0100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "避開「守住」這種會使攻擊無效的\n招式發動的時機，再發動攻擊；<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "907F958B300C5B884F4F300D90197A2E67034F7F653B64CA712165487684000A62DB5F0F767C52D5768466426A5FFF0C518D767C52D5653B64CAFF1B00100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "或是搭配瞄準要害的道具等等……\n可以研擬各式各樣的戰略。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6216662F642D914D77846E9689815BB37684905351777B497B4920262026000A53EF4EE5781464EC54045F0F54046A23768462307565300200100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不只如此……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D53EA59826B642026202600100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那個……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3500B202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還沒結束嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90846C927D50675F55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……滔滔不絕地\n說了這麼多，不好意思。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n雖然魅力之處還多得是……\n但那些就用對戰來告訴<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440202620266ED46ED44E0D7D555730000A8AAA4E8690199EBC591AFF0C4E0D597D610F601D300200100001BE01000A96D671369B45529B4E4B86559084591A5F97662F20262026000A4F4690A34E9B5C3175285C0D62304F86544A8A3400100003110000FF01014F6059B35427300200100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要對戰了，\n就請跟我說一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
