      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "另外，發動招式的期間沒有防備，\n因此不能不考量使用的時機……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E65916FF0C767C52D562DB5F0F7684671F95936C92670996325099FF0C000A56E06B644E0D80FD4E0D800391CF4F7F7528768466426A5F2026202600100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊……經過戰鬥之後，\n冒出了好多連續招式需要思考的問題……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A554A202620267D93904E62309B254E4B5F8CFF0C000A519251FA4E86597D591A90237E8C62DB5F0F97008981601D80037684554F984C2026202600100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那個……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3500B202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還沒結束嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90846C927D50675F55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……滔滔不絕地\n說了這麼多，不好意思。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n請務必收下這一個招式學習器。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440202620266ED46ED44E0D7D555730000A8AAA4E8690199EBC591AFF0C4E0D597D610F601D300200100001BE01000A8ACB52D95FC565364E0B90194E00500B62DB5F0F5B787FD25668300200100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冰屬性的招式<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>三旋擊<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\n會連續跳躍3次，優美地攻擊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B05C6C6027768462DB5F0F00100002FF0000064E0965CB64CA00100002FF000000000A670390237E8C8DF38E8D00336B21FF0C512A7F8E5730653B64CA300200100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不只如此！第2次會比第1次，\n第3次會比第2次跳得還要高，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n攻擊範圍也會越來越大！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D53EA59826B64FF017B2C00326B2167036BD47B2C00316B21FF0C000A7B2C00336B2167036BD47B2C00326B218DF35F97908489819AD8FF0C00100001BE00000A653B64CA7BC4570D4E5F67038D8A4F868D8A5927FF0100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所有的攻擊都擊中時的快感……\n各種要素都環環相扣的戰略性……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳務必要體驗看看\n連續招式的美妙之處。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
